###

POST http://localhost:4000/api/content/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "SQL Window Functions",
  "audience": "Data Analytics Students",
  "contentType": "Daily Tip",
  "tone": "Friendly and Educational",
  "language": "English"
}

###

### Same topic again → expect 409 DUPLICATE_TOPIC (add "bypassDuplicate": true to force)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/content/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "Power BI vs Excel",
  "audience": "Working Professionals",
  "contentType": "Educational Post"
}

###

GET http://localhost:4000/api/content?limit=10

###

### Edit content (never blocked) — replace id
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/content/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "📚 *SQL Tip of the Day*\n\nROW_NUMBER() assigns a unique number to each row within a group..."
}

###

POST http://localhost:4000/api/content/1/approve

###

POST http://localhost:4000/api/content/1/regenerate

###

DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/content/1
